<title>UK: British Asset Trust buys back loan stock.</title>
<headline>British Asset Trust buys back loan stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Assets Trust Plc said on Friday it had purchase 2.6 million units of Equities Index unsecured loan stock on Thursday for cancellation at a price of 212.35 pence per unit.</p>
<p>After the transaction, which corresponded to the cancellation of 1.9 percent of the original loan stock issued, the company said it now had 44.1 million such units in issue.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
